---
import InfoPage from '../layouts/InfoPage.astro';
import { CONTACT_EMAIL, LEGAL_UPDATED } from '../data/site.js';
---

<InfoPage
  title="Privacy Policy | winisland"
  description="How winisland.in handles your data: tools run in your browser, lists stay on your device, no accounts. Details on cookies, Google AdSense ads and hosting logs."
  kicker="Privacy"
  heading="Privacy Policy"
  intro="Short version: the tools run in your browser, your lists stay on your device, and we never ask you to sign up."
  updated={LEGAL_UPDATED}
>
  <section class="panel">
    <h2>Who we are</h2>
    <p>
      This policy covers <strong>winisland.in</strong> ("winisland", "we", "us"), a free website of party and giveaway
      tools. If you have any question about it, email us at <a href={`mailto:${CONTACT_EMAIL}`}>{CONTACT_EMAIL}</a>.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="panel">
    <h2>What we don't collect</h2>
    <p>
      winisland has no accounts, no login and no database. The names, entries, scores and settings you type into our
      tools are processed by your own browser and are never uploaded to us. We don't sell personal information, and we
      don't ask for your social media passwords.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="panel">
    <h2>What is saved on your device</h2>
    <p>
      So you don't lose your work when you close the tab, the tools save a few things in your browser's local storage.
      This data stays on your device; we can't see it.
    </p>
    <ul>
      <li>The lists and options you entered in each tool (wheel names, giveaway entries, players, Secret Santa names, budget and draw).</li>
      <li>Scores and history for the coin toss and dice roller.</li>
      <li>A tambola game in progress, its settings and room code, and the name and marked numbers of a player in a room.</li>
      <li>Whether sound effects are on.</li>
    </ul>
    <p>
      The site also stores its own pages and files in your browser cache so the tools work offline. You can delete all of
      this at any time by clearing this site's data in your browser settings.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="panel">
    <h2>Links you share</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>
        <strong>Tambola room links</strong> contain the room code and ticket settings. A player's name stays on their own
        phone.
      </li>
      <li>
        <strong>Secret Santa reveal links</strong> carry the match after the <code>#</code> in the address. Browsers never
        send that part to any server, so we can't see who got whom. Anyone who has the link can open it, so send each one
        only to the right person.
      </li>
      <li>
        <strong>Share buttons</strong> (WhatsApp, your phone's share menu or copy to clipboard) hand the text to the app you
        choose. That app's own privacy policy then applies.
      </li>
    </ul>
  </section>

  <section class="panel">
    <h2>Tambola voice</h2>
    <p>
      The number caller reads numbers aloud using the speech voices built into your device or browser. Most voices run
      on your device. Some browsers offer online voices (for example Google voices in Chrome); if you pick one of those,
      the text being read is sent to that company to turn it into speech.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="panel">
    <h2>Hosting and server logs</h2>
    <p>
      The site is hosted by Cloudflare. Like any website host, Cloudflare processes technical information when you visit,
      such as your IP address, browser type and the pages requested, to deliver the site and protect it from abuse.
      See <a href="https://www.cloudflare.com/privacypolicy/" rel="noopener">Cloudflare's privacy policy</a>. We don't use this
      information to identify you.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="panel">
    <h2>Advertising and cookies</h2>
    <p>
      To keep winisland free, we may show ads from Google AdSense. When ads are shown:
    </p>
    <ul>
      <li>Third-party vendors, including Google, use cookies to serve ads based on your previous visits to this and other websites.</li>
      <li>
        Google's use of advertising cookies lets it and its partners serve ads to you based on your visits to this site
        and/or other sites on the internet.
      </li>
      <li>
        You can opt out of personalised advertising in <a href="https://adssettings.google.com/" rel="noopener">Google
        Ads Settings</a>, or opt out of some third-party vendors' cookies
        at <a href="https://www.aboutads.info/choices/" rel="noopener">aboutads.info</a>.
      </li>
      <li>
        Learn more in <a href="https://policies.google.com/technologies/partner-sites" rel="noopener">How Google uses
        information from sites that use its services</a>.
      </li>
    </ul>
    <p>
      Visitors in the European Economic Area, the UK and Switzerland are asked for consent before personalised ads are
      shown, and can change their choice at any time. Our own tools don't set cookies; they only use local storage as
      described above.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="panel">
    <h2>Links to other sites</h2>
    <p>
      Some pages link to other websites, and some links may be affiliate links (for example to Amazon), which means we may
      earn a small commission if you buy something, at no extra cost to you. Those sites have their own privacy policies
      and may use their own cookies.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="panel">
    <h2>Children</h2>
    <p>
      winisland is made for families, classrooms and friends, and we don't knowingly collect personal information from
      anyone, including children under 13. If you believe a child has sent us personal information by email, contact us
      and we will delete it.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="panel">
    <h2>Your rights</h2>
    <p>
      Depending on where you live (for example under the GDPR in Europe or India's Digital Personal Data Protection Act),
      you may have the right to access, correct or delete personal data held about you. The only personal data we may
      hold is what you send us by email. Write to <a href={`mailto:${CONTACT_EMAIL}`}>{CONTACT_EMAIL}</a> and we'll help.
      Data saved by the tools is on your own device, and you can delete it yourself by clearing this site's data.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="panel">
    <h2>Changes to this policy</h2>
    <p>
      If we change how winisland handles data, we will update this page and the "Last updated" date at the top. Please
      check back from time to time.
    </p>
  </section>
</InfoPage>
